        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Paris/_scene_paris.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 6f4dcd7a-f1ca-436b-a7f2-be53f6fd3794).Image",
        "Description": "Hello, 0047. MI6 seemed pleased with your last operation, and are tasking another.\r\rWith the data you collected, we&apos;ve identified the organization as &apos;SLAVA,&apos; an extremist terrorist cell working behind corrupt governments. A former agent of ours, Pierrette De Brisay, defected to SLAVA and informed them that we have caught on, thus losing our element of surprise.\r\rDe Brisay will be at a black market auction in Paris. Assassinate her, and several high-rank SLAVA guards. Dessert will be messy, 47.",
